        "source": "External finite-product Gaussian W12 theorem with differentiability/continuous partials and entropy-domain hypotheses.",
        "lean": "Actual C2compact class with all L1 domains internally produced and homogeneous coordinate-energy bound2."
      },
      {
        "source": "SPHMC FIRST4.6 invokes GaussianLSI and Talagrand without printing this compact proof.",
        "lean": "For every n>=0 and signed real C2 compactly supported f on Fin n -> Real, let gamma_n be the actual product of n independent centered variance-one scalar Gaussian laws and D_i f(x)=fderiv Real f x(Pi.single i1). The theorem internally produces L1 of f squared, f squared times log(f squared), every coordinate derivative squared and their finite sum, and proves homogeneous Ent_gamma_n(f squared)<=2 integral sum_i(D_i f)^2. Zero mass and dimension0 are included."
      },
      {
        "source": "External finite conditional-entropy/tower and scalar W12 assembly.",
        "lean": "Actual boundedbinary39 plus compactscalar38 and strict dimension induction on original C2compact slices."
      },
      {
        "source": "Finite-Hilbert gradient interpretation, noncompact posterior cutoff, T2/FIRST, both main algorithm and cost results.",
        "lean": "Actual Measure.pi centered variance-one scalar Gaussian for every n including0; true function-square/Phi-square/all-partial-square/full-sum energy L1 plus homogeneous entropy<=2 coordinate-square-sum integral. Only n,f,C2,compact support inputs. Default Pi sup norm is not Euclidean gradient energy. No RMS marginal smoothness, L1/domain/LSI certificate or positive dimension/mass premise. Finite Hilbert law/orthonormal gradient Parseval, noncompact cutoff32/33, separate T2/FIRST4.6 and all paper main/work/composition remain open. Actual3184 focused build and genuine zero/alln, positive-mass n0, signed n1 and nonseparable signed n2 consumers pass with standard3 axioms. Independent proof/fidelity/commit/shared admission remains pending."
      }
    ]
